  "description": "The RUUT AL LTD is a solid entry-level all-rounder, available in three sleek finishes - ideal as a first gravel bike, winter trainer, or reliable commuter. Built around the updated RUUT G2 aluminium frame, it now comes in a clean, modern look with refined lines and internal cable routing. The TwinTip carbon fork allows adjustable geometry, letting you switch between a more sporty or more relaxed position depending on your ride. The bike is equipped with a SRAM APEX 1x11 drivetrain, REVER MCX-2 mechanical disc brakes, and a durable RONDO Direct 42T crankset, offering smooth and dependable performance on all kinds of terrain. With bridgeless seatstays and full rack, fender, and bottle cage mounts, the RUUT AL LTD is ready for anything from weekday commutes to weekend bikepacking trips. WTB Nano 700x40C tires, lightweight RONDO hubs, and Ryde Rival rims complete a package that delivers performance, reliability, and style - all at an accessible price point.",
